usage: retire_view_first_sources.py [-h] --dataset-root DATASET_ROOT
                                    --spool-root SPOOL_ROOT --source-policy
                                    SOURCE_POLICY --recipe-id RECIPE_ID
                                    [--task TASK] [--episode EPISODE]
                                    [--expected-episodes EXPECTED_EPISODES]
                                    [--resume] (--plan | --execute)

Plan or explicitly retire independently verified View-first VAE sources. Never
loads a VAE, renderer, MuJoCo or raw RoboCasa source. Use isolated samples
until independent Gates A-D pass; this command does not authorize corpus GC.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --dataset-root DATASET_ROOT
  --spool-root SPOOL_ROOT
  --source-policy SOURCE_POLICY
  --recipe-id RECIPE_ID
  --task TASK
  --episode EPISODE
  --expected-episodes EXPECTED_EPISODES
  --resume              repair prior owned retirement intents before
                        inspecting source manifests
  --plan
  --execute
